    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulvīnārĭum</span></b> ,
			ĭi, n. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A cushioned seat</i> or <i>couch</i>
			of the gods (for the usual pulvinar), <i><span class="en">Liv. 21,
			62</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An anchorage</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Cas.
				3, 2, 27</span></i>.</div>
